{"version":1,"id":"morgan-wallen-cover-me-up","title":"Cover Me Up","artist":"Morgan Wallen","key":"D","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/morgan-wallen/cover-me-up/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Jason Isbell and Morgan Wallen","chords":[{"symbol":"D","canonical":"D","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,6,9],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"G","canonical":"G","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,11,2],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Bm","canonical":"Bm","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,2,6],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Em","canonical":"Em","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,7,11],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"section","text":"[Primeira Parte]","columns":16,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"A heart on the run, keeps a hand on the gun, it can’t trust anyone","columns":66,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":16,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":39,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":62,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"I was so sure, what I needed was more, tried to shoot out the sun","columns":65,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":33,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":63,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"In days when we raged, we flew off the page, such damage was done","columns":65,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":39,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":60,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"But I made it through, ‘cause somebody knew, I was meant for","columns":60,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"Someone","columns":7,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão 1]","columns":10,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"So girl leave your boots by the bed we ain’t leavin’ this room","columns":62,"beats":3,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":32,"beat":1},{"symbol":"D","column":58,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"Till someone needs medical help or the magnolias bloom","columns":54,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":27,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":49,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"It’s cold in this house and I ain’t goin’ out to chop wood","columns":58,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":30,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Bm","column":53,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"So cover me up and know you’re enough to use me for good","columns":56,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":32,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":52,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"section","text":"[Segunda Parte]","columns":15,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"Put your faith to the test, when I tore off your dress, in","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":22,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":49,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"Richmond-on-high","columns":16,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":11,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"I sobered up, and I swore off that stuff, forever this time","columns":59,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":35,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":55,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"And the old lovers’ say, I thought it’d be me, who helped him get","columns":65,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":19,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":45,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"Home","columns":4,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":2,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"But home was a dream, one I’d never seen, ‘til you came along","columns":61,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":36,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":57,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão 2]","columns":10,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"So girl hang your dress up to dry, we ain’t leavin’ this room","columns":61,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":30,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":57,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"Til the Percy Priest breaks open wide and the river runs through","columns":64,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":30,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":54,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"Carries this house on the stones like a piece of driftwood","columns":58,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":25,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Bm","column":54,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"Cover me up and know you’re enough to use me for good","columns":53,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":29,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":49,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"instrumental","text":"","columns":9,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":3,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":8,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"instrumental","text":"","columns":9,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":3,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":8,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão 1]","columns":10,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"So girl leave your boots by the bed we ain’t leavin’ this room","columns":62,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":32,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":58,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"Til someone needs medical help or the magnolia’s bloom","columns":54,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":22,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":45,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"It’s cold in this house and I ain’t goin’ out to chop wood","columns":58,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":30,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Bm","column":54,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"So cover me up and know you’re enough to use me for good","columns":56,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":32,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":52,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"Cover me up and know you’re enough to use me for good","columns":53,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":29,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":49,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"instrumental","text":"","columns":7,"beats":3,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":3,"beat":1},{"symbol":"D","column":6,"beat":2}]}]}